From: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 23:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: vendor-prefixes: Add The Minimal Company

The Minimal Company makes the Minimal Phone (MP01), an MT6789 phone
with an e-paper display and a hardware keyboard.

Signed-off-by: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
@@ -1053,6 +1053,8 @@
     description: Changzhou Milianke Electronic Technology Co., Ltd
   "^milkv,.*":
     description: MilkV Technology Co., Ltd
+  "^minimal,.*":
+    description: The Minimal Company
   "^miniand,.*":
     description: Miniand Tech
   "^minix,.*":
